Compare the performance of the S&P 500 against similar global indices (e.g., FTSE 100, Nikkei 225, Euro Stoxx 50). Identify any divergences or correlations. If the S&P 500 is significantly outperforming or underperforming other major indices without a clear fundamental reason, adjust sentiment accordingly. Cross reference global political news that would make US performance diverge from international markets to refine prediction sentiment and conviction, giving high value to macro predictions with an explanation. For example, increased US rates but decreases in international rates would lead to positive conviction with high probability and low volatility markets, higher volatility otherwise.